Package: StableEstim
Type: Package
Title: Estimate the Four Parameters of Stable Laws using Different
        Methods
Version: 2.4
Depends: R (>= 2.10.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, numDeriv, fBasics, MASS, methods,
        stabledist, Rdpack
